{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650160/extras/53acc29ad133a9b6ffabc4b43979629c.avif?t=1773933320\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650160/extras_big/53acc29ad133a9b6ffabc4b43979629c.avif?t=1773933320 width=800 height=566 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where striking visuals meet deep, tactical gameplay. The game stands out with its unique art style \u2014 bold colors, expressive characters, and slick animations create an atmosphere that\u2019s both immersive and unforgettable. Every card feels like a collectible masterpiece, and even boss fights turn into full-blown visual spectacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, this is a carefully crafted collectible card game. Players build decks, discover powerful synergies, and unleash devastating combos to outsmart their opponents. Every match is a mental showdown where smart plays and well-timed combinations make all the difference.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650160/extras/4adc9b78a708b5997b6170024a29a9ad.avif?t=1773933320\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650160/extras_big/4adc9b78a708b5997b6170024a29a9ad.avif?t=1773933320 width=800 height=566 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the game lies a rich collectible system that appeals to both newcomers and seasoned card game veterans. With hundreds of unique cards to discover\u2014each with its own abilities, artwork, and lore\u2014there\u2019s always something new to chase. Cards come in varying levels of rarity, making each pack opening or boss reward a thrilling experience full of potential surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare and Epic cards are especially prized\u2014not just for their powerful effects in battle, but as coveted trophies in your collection. Some are unlocked only by defeating elite bosses or completing special challenges, turning the hunt for the perfect deck into an adventure of its own. Building your collection isn\u2019t just a feature\u2014it\u2019s part of the game\u2019s soul.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650160/extras/f180d86f49718d2e6007af68c1732e2b.avif?t=1773933320\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650160/extras_big/f180d86f49718d2e6007af68c1732e2b.avif?t=1773933320 width=800 height=566 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the heat of card battles, the game offers a bold social twist \u2014 private chats with in-game heroines. Each character has her own personality, style, and story to uncover. Through flirty dialogue and smart choices, you can build connections, deepen relationships, and unlock more intimate conversations over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a game that blends strategic depth, collectible thrills, and unexpected romantic twists. With intense battles, a massive roster of unique cards, charismatic heroines, and a bold visual identity, this isn\u2019t just another card game \u2014 it\u2019s an experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're ready for something different \u2014 something smart, stylish, and a little provocative \u2014 add the game to your wishlist now. Don\u2019t miss your chance to be among the first to dive into this one-of-a-kind adventure. </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fresh Look","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3650160/9ae470ebbf6c1b7226cbbac7ede45b0766ccaad9.jpg"},{"name":"Warmed Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3650160/3422d58901a19994290a09d3fb