ds strategic depth, collectible thrills, and unexpected romantic twists. With intense battles, a massive roster of unique cards, charismatic heroines, and a bold visual identity, this isn\u2019t just another card game \u2014 it\u2019s an experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're ready for something different \u2014 something smart, stylish, and a little provocative \u2014 add the game to your wishlist now. Don\u2019t miss your chance to be among the first to dive into this one-of-a-kind adventure. </p>","developers":["Asomgames"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650160/e2d12bf08716ae48122b61f58c7761b057216858/header_alt_assets_16.jpg?t=1773933320","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3650160/1259867412/3900b4f0a754a36bbc4f136a4196dab6b1e49924/1750411558/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750419596","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3650160/1259867412/3900b4f0a754a36bbc4f136a4196dab6b1e49924/1750411558/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750419596","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3650160/1259867412/3900b4f0a754a36bbc4f136a4196dab6b1e49924/1750411558/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750419596","id":257159199,"name":"Harem of Lust: trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257159199/77811d39c2d48297e82ed551ce822154b8441cba/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750419596"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3650160/872474/b485c699f5b3d60a23bbcbf2a0cbdd60936ded79/1750413462/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745527460","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3650160/872474/b485c699f5b3d60a23bbcbf2a0cbdd60936ded79/1750413462/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745527460","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.ak